        <mxCell id="prod_obs" value="Pós-deploy em prod — Observabilidade ao vivo&#xa;&#xa;Health endpoint:        GET /api/webhooks/clickup/patient/_health → { status, uptimeSeconds }&#xa;Smoke test executável:  scripts/smoke-test-clickup-webhook.ts --target prod (4 sub-tests, ~7s)&#xa;Logs estruturados:      18 eventos no Cloud Logging com correlationId, sem PII&#xa;Cloud Monitoring:       saved queries no RUNBOOK (alertar conflicts &gt;1/d, hmac_invalid &gt;5/min, fetch_failed &gt;3/min)&#xa;CLI backfill:           import-patients-from-clickup.ts --live (replay quando webhook offline)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#2E7D32;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
